mem pcm wavetable.bin
# Pitch: one channel on wave 2 (16-bit, looped) stepping through every
# octave from -8 to 7 with the F-number at 0, 0x155, 0x2aa and 0x3ff, by
# rewriting registers 0x20 and 0x38 under the key. Octave -8 makes ymfm
# shift by -1, which C leaves undefined.
